  {
   "key": "0x1E0",
   "name": "SN76496 alias at 01E0h",
   "source": "emulator",
   "searched": [
    {
     "where": "mame-header",
     "gave": "MAME's sn76496.cpp header cites the SN76489 document, which names no port; its Tandy driver installs the chip at 00C0h only."
    },
    {
     "where": "maker",
     "gave": "The Tandy 1000 SL manual maps 00C0-00C3 and no 01E0h."
    },
    {
     "where": "bitsavers",
     "gave": "The Tandy folder holds the Model 100, 2000 and 6000 service manuals only."
    },
    {
     "where": "archive-org",
     "gave": "The Tandy 1000 EX technical reference is held there as full text; it names no 01E0h, though it gives few port numbers."
    },
    {
     "where": "index",
     "gave": "Web searches for 01E0h with Tandy gave the PSSJ DAC at 00C4h and no 01E0h port."
    }
   ],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/tandy_sound.cpp",
     "lines": "325"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/tandy_sound.cpp",
     "lines": "74-85"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "On a machine that is not Tandy, with tandy enabled and no Sound Blaster, DOSBox-X installs SN76496Write at 0x01E0.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/tandy_sound.cpp",
       "lines": "302-306",
       "sha": "341308062e6ac0b672bbb3d61814f0c9c917d4bdd474580f8f3cb527de7d3a8a"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/tandy_sound.cpp",
       "lines": "314-325",
       "sha": "0ab8ce5cf69312c99e77fddbd7874d6310471404d2230aa9dafbb08726749c2e"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "The handler ignores which port called it, so 0x01E0 programs the same registers as 0x00C0.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/tandy_sound.cpp",
       "lines": "74-85",
       "sha": "c057d2222fd5ccf1da3d0b76a2911a0cd52887af0d13004dd67cec800ce73d63"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "P",
     "on": "place",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "place",
     "text": "DOSBox-X reaches it through the SN76496Write handler installed for two ports at 0x01E0.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/tandy_sound.cpp",
       "lines": "325",
       "sha": "d3f4c41cec8caa95eea755c9991cb660a88c0b89db8438a4e5c889bbd4d2136d"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:include/inout.h",
       "lines": "155",
       "sha": "76cce2d4666bd2ff6a265c2efbe9e9a468649b35ed2a2c98417bb913a2bbae02"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
